From 7fa96692c2485ffa2d9503faf973308c19a004ab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zeroday0619 <escha@zeroday0619.dev>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 12:45:09 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 6/9] fix: align shared controls and WAF status presentation

From: Codex <codex@localhost>

Remove line clamping that replaced the flex layout inside select triggers and collapsed indicator spacing. Correct Radix variable syntax, menu sizing and elevation. Align search fields, tabs, segmented controls and filter popovers across desktop and mobile layouts. Show disabled WAF mode with a neutral indicator instead of an error color. TypeScript, 56 focused tests, custom runtime tests and 39 responsive route checks passed.
